_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01A7ALAYG75iPpLSRN9uwDba", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 738256, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UU2zaLjArRjnCffEj1Nrit", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "Fixes the nightly failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` was using `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but the docstring and FIN-212 specify banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`). The test expects `Decimal(\"2.665\")` to round to `2.66` (half-even), which HALF_UP gets wrong (`2.67`).\n\nChange: `src/money.py` switches the rounding mode from `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. No other changes on the branch beyond merging the latest main.\n\nCI: run ci-0002 passed on 0a9452f727.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr-0a9452f727"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 739156, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UU2zaLjArRjnCffEj1Nrit", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-money-rounding-pr-0a9452f727", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 739156, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UU2zaLjArRjnCffEj1Nrit", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 741854, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I opened PR #101 against main, requesting review from alex: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nWhat I did:\n- **Root cause:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but the docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding. With HALF_UP, `Decimal(\"2.665\")` rounds to `2.67`, and the test expects `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That is the only change to the code.\n- **CI:** The first run (ci-0001, on 08d3cd5986) passed. The PR was rejected because the branch was behind main, so I merged main into the branch (now 0a9452f727). I re-ran CI on that commit (ci-0002), and it passed.\n- **Not done:** I did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner, so that is still pending.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the source file.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01APkfwEbwgKucseN1FoYvX2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Ra6ed5j6Av8Z7NhnFSgM7S", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, but the code uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`. Under HALF_UP, `2.665` rounds to `2.67`, while the test expects `2.66`. I'll create the branch and make the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UJiYi7VQGQ2pLjuoTEtJE6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VPHHqbwFQ3DNa2GzoQKvrX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_E